\r\nWhat more can I do\r\nOh, Baby all I want for Christmas is you\r\n\r\nAll the lights are shining\r\nSo brightly everywhere\r\nAnd the sound of children\'s\r\nLaughter fills the air\r\n\r\nAnd everyone is singing\r\nI hear those sleigh bells ringing\r\nSanta won\'t you bring me\r\nThe one I really need\r\nWon\'t you please bring my baby to me quickly\r\n\r\nI don\'t want a lot for Christmas\r\nThis is all I\'m asking for\r\nI just wanna see my baby\r\nStanding right outside my door\r\n\r\nI just want you for my own\r\nMore than you could ever know\r\nMake my wish come true\r\nBaby all I want for Christmas is you\r\n\r\nAll I want for Christmas is you, baby','yXQViqx6GMY'),(25,'Oh Santa','Mariah Carey','mariah-carey.jpg','Mariah Carey has debuted a new remix of Oh Santa! featuring Ariana Grande and Jennifer Hudson. \r\nThe festive track and its official music video were part of Mimi\'s new Apple TV special Mariah Carey\'s Magical Christmas Special which is now available to stream.','https://mariahcarey.com/','Oh, Santa\'s gonna come and make him mine this Christmas\r\nSanta\'s gonna come and make him mine, mine\r\nOh Santa\r\nSanta\'s gonna come and make him mine this Christmas\r\nSanta\'s gonna come and make him mine, mine\r\nOh Santa\r\n \r\n[Verse 1]\r\nSanta\r\nIf you get this letter\r\nWon\'t you help me out?\r\nI know you\'re kinda busy with your elves right now\r\nAnd I don\'t know how\r\nYou do the things you do while I sleep on Christmas eve\r\nBut it\'s amazing\r\nAnd I bet that you could bring me back my baby\r\nBecause every time I see Christmas lights\r\nI feel this burn inside\r\nAnd I just can\'t take it\r\n \r\n[Pre-Chorus 1]\r\nI saw them shopping last week\r\nAnd his new girl was so bleak\r\nAnd then I swore to myself\r\nSanta\'s gonna come and make him mine this Christmas night\r\n \r\n[Chorus]\r\nHo, ho, ho\r\nSanta\'s gonna come and make you mine this Christmas\r\nSanta\'s gonna come and make you mine, ho, ho, ho\r\nSanta\'s gonna come and mak