on\r\nCome on, come on, come on\r\nCome on, come on, come on\r\n\r\nLet it snow..., Let it snow...\r\nLet it snow...\r\nLet it snow...\r\nLet it snow\r\nLet it snow..... (Repeat)','Ko3yBFoTm5c'),(431,'The First Noel','Whitney Houston','santa-radio.jpg','Whitney Elizabeth Houston was an American singer, actress, producer, and model. In 2009, Guinness World Records cited her as the most awarded female act of all time.','https://www.whitneyhouston.com/','The first NoÃ«l, the angel did say,\r\nWas to certain poor shepherds in fields as they lay;\r\nIn fields where they lay tending their sheep,\r\nOn a cold winter\'s night that was so deep.\r\nNoÃ«l, NoÃ«l, NoÃ«l, NoÃ«l\r\nBorn is the King of Israel.\r\n\r\nThey looked up and saw a star\r\nShining in the East, beyond them far; \r\nAnd to the earth it gave great light,\r\nAnd so it continued both day and night. \r\nNoÃ«l, NoÃ«l, NoÃ«l, NoÃ«l\r\nBorn is the King of Israel.\r\n\r\nJesus Christ is\r\nBorn is the King of Israel. [2x]\r\n\r\nNoÃ«l, NoÃ«l, NoÃ«l\r\nBorn is the King of Israel.\r\n\r\nJesus\r\nThe first NoÃ«l\r\nHe is the Son yeah\r\nBorn is the King of\r\nKing of\r\nOh yeah yeah\r\nOh Christ is born\r\nOoh hallelujah hey\r\nHe is born\r\nOh Christ the King is born','YaukRXZzxeo'),(432,'I Need You (Christmas Mix)','3T','santa-radio.jpg','3T is an American R&B/pop music group featuring the three sons of Tito Jackson and Delores ','https://www.titojackson.com/about/3t','I need you, girl\r\nI couldn\'t live a day without you\r\n\r\nWell I tried to write a special song\r\nA love song just for you\r\nTo explain the way you make me feel inside\r\nThough the meaning may be simple\r\nAnd the words may not be new\r\nI couldn\'t make it clearer if I tried\r\n\r\nI need you\r\nAnd I couldn\'t live a day without you\r\nI need you\r\nMore than anyone could ever know\r\nI need you\r\nAnd I wanna build my world around you\r\nI need you\r\nI need you\r\n\r\nWell I sang the words and realized\r\nIt\'d all been said before\r\nSo I