 lay-abouts\r\nWhat will they do now?\r\nWhen Christmas comes around\r\nWe were so in love\r\nTill I messed it up\r\nBut who will love me now\r\nWhen Christmas comes around\r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\nAnd, I\'m sick of all the songs\r\nThe Christmas sing-alongs\r\nThe merry and the cheer\r\nBut I don\'t feel like that this year\r\nAll the bells are all in sync\r\nAnd my soul is on the brink\r\nSo I\'ll have myself a change, and sing\r\nWhen Christmas comes around\r\n\r\n[Chorus + Outro]\r\nFor the down and outs\r\nAnd broken lay-abouts\r\nWhat will they do now?\r\nWhen Christmas comes around\r\nWe were so in love\r\nTill I messed it up\r\nBut who will love me now\r\nWhen Christmas comes around','hLOfyEhMjHs'),(456,'Reggae Reggae Christmas','Levi Roots','santa-radio.jpg','\'Reggae Reggae Christmas\' an infectious song is out on Nov 09th \'17 | Please show support & help us make history with the worlds 1st ever Reggae Xmas hit. ðŸŽ…ðŸ¾','https://leviroots.com/','REGGAE REGGAE XMAS \r\n\r\nITâ€™S CHRISTMAS TIME AN WEH FEELING FINE \r\nWE HAVE DI MISELTOE, DI TURKEY AND WE GOT DI WINE \r\nWITH FAMILY PRESENCE, AND LOTS OF PRESENTS \r\nLOVE, MUSIC, LAUGHTER FUN AND PARTY TIME\r\n\r\nWEâ€™RE GONNA HAVE A REGGAE REGGAE XMAS AND LOTS OF FUN \r\nFESTIVE REGGAE CELEBRATIONS FOR EVERYONE \r\nEVERYBODY EAT AND DANCE AND TING \r\nDRINK A GLASS TO LIFE AND WIN WIN WIN \r\nLETâ€™S HAVE A REGGAE REGGAE XMAS AND LOTS OF FUN \r\n\r\nNOW WE FINISH WORK, WE GOT PLENTY JERK AND TWERK \r\nWE EYES DEM PON DI TV WATCHING CAPTAIN KIRK \r\nLIFE IS GOOD AND WE RESPEK ITâ€™S WORTH \r\nWE ALL BROUGHT TOGETHER FROM DI JESUS BIRTH \r\n\r\nWEâ€™RE GONNA HAVE A REGGAE REGGAE XMAS AND LOTS OF FUN \r\nFESTIVE REGGAE CELEBRATIONS FOR EVERYONE \r\nEVERYBODY EAT AND DANCE AND TING \r\nDRINK A GLASS TO LIFE AND WIN WIN WIN \r\nLETâ€™S HAVE A REGGAE REGGAE XMAS AND LOTS OF FUN \r\n\r\nMOTHER PON SHE FEET, SHE DANCING TO THE BEAT \r\nCHILDREN PLAYING SWEET, FATHER CARVE DI MEAT \r\nEVERYBODY SIT, AND DO DEM LITTLE