 town','cF_6J7d0EN4'),(458,'Baby it\'s Christmas','Bananarama','santa-radio.jpg','For the first time in their career, Bananarama have recorded a Christmas song. The glittering dance track Baby it\'s Christmas, written by Sara Dallin and producer Ian Masterson, will be released in the UK as a special Christmas gift early December 2010','https://ww2.bananarama.co.uk/','Baby it\'s Christmas time\r\nBaby it\'s Christmas time\r\n\r\nAll is silent here tonight\r\nItÂ´s cold outside but the fire\'s bright\r\nAnd my thoughts they turn to you\r\n(And my thoughts they turn to you)\r\n\r\nAnd I wonder how you sleep\r\nCause I know my heart you keep\r\nAnd someday you\'ll realize\r\n\r\nSo baby just stop, stop pulling my heart strings\r\nWon\'t you come back and make my heart sing?\r\nYou\'ve been away far too long\r\nAre you coming home?\r\n\r\nRemember how we kissed that time\r\nThe mistletoe and too much wine\r\nAt Christmas time\r\n\r\nBaby It\'s Christmas time\r\n\r\nAnd I wonder where you are\r\nIf I wish upon a star\r\nWill it bring you home to me?\r\n \r\nYou can catch the midnight flight\r\nYou\'ll be here by morning light\r\nBack in my arms again\r\n\r\nSo baby just stop, stop pulling my heart strings\r\nWon\'t you come back and make my heart sing?\r\nYou\'ve been away far too long\r\nAre you coming home?\r\n\r\nRemember how we kissed that time\r\nThe mistletoe and too much wine\r\nAt Christmas time\r\n\r\nBaby It\'s Christmas time\r\n\r\nAnd I wonder how you sleep\r\nCause I know my heart you keep\r\nAnd someday you\'ll realize\r\n\r\nSo baby just stop, stop pulling my heart strings\r\nWon\'t you come back and make my heart sing?\r\nYou\'ve been away far too long\r\nAre you coming home?\r\n\r\nRemember how we kissed that time\r\nThe mistletoe and too much wine\r\nAt Christmas time\r\n\r\nBaby It\'s Christmas time\r\nBaby It\'s Christmas time\r\nBaby It\'s Christmas time\r\nBaby It\'s Christmas time','bb5QQTdgvoE'),(459,'Another Christmas Time','Andrew Collins','santa-radio.jpg','Bournemouth-based songwriter Andrew Collins is releasing his new single â€˜Another Christmas Timeâ€™ under major label Warner Music Group, teaming up with Warnerâ€™s Filipina singer, Monique de los Santos who has appeared in well-known TV shows such as American Idol, The Voice Philippines and Pilipinas Got Talent.','https://open.spotify.com/track/5rQctUaUiD5YTZzKCAICam','every city street has a tree\r\nlight shines on each famous avenue\r\nevery choir sings a symphony\r\ncelebrating the new king holy Emmanuel\r\nsnow will soon be falling from the sky\r\nanother winter, another Christmas time\r\nonce upon a dream when all the stars were shining\r\nthe town was white and on that night\r\nthe music started playing\r\nthe music played Hallelujah\r\nthe angels were singing another Christmas time\r\n\r\ntime to celebrate a time of peace\r\nstars are shining another Christmas eve\r\nthen a snowflake starts falling from the sky\r\nanother winter, another Christmas time\r\ntime for us to meet, look at the stars shine\r\nthe angels are singing because its Christmas time\r\n\r\nso the snow has started falling from the sky\r\nanother winter, another Christmas time\r\nwhat a Christmas theme, with all the stars shining\r\nan illuminated, festive frozen scene!\r\nlike a candle or a sleigh ride in the mind\r\nit\'s another Christmas time\r\nand on new years eve, look at the stars shine\r\nall the magic we can see\r\nis the final fantasy\r\nof another Christmas dream','Ua8TEond0cs'),(460,'Kids at Christmas','Scouting For Girls','santa-radio.jpg','Taken from the bandâ€™s latest album â€˜Ten Add Tenâ€™, â€˜Kids At Christmasâ€™ is one of ten brand new pop bangers, alongside the classics â€˜Sheâ€™s So Lovelyâ€™, â€˜Elvis Aint Deadâ€™, â€˜Heartbeatâ€™, â€˜I Wish I Was James Bondâ€™ and UK #1 â€˜This Ainâ€™t A Love Songâ€™. â€˜\r\nKids At Christmasâ€™ is brimming with festive cheer and catchy melodies, so much so that vocalist Roy Stride had his children do guest vocals on the single and jokes that maybe next time heâ€™ll get the dog on board too.','https://www.scoutingforgirls.com','We were like \r\nUp all night\r\nCrazy like \r\nKids at Christmas\r\n\r\nDo you remember the night?\r\nDecember thousand and five \r\nDo you even know that you started a fire?\r\nI was out on my own \r\nwith nowhere to go\r\nsomehow we ended up back at my home.\r\nDarling you make me wanna sing out loud\r\nCause being with you makes such a beautiful sound.\r\nI was falling in love like the snow from the sky \r\nIt was the best damn day of my life, yeah.\r\n\r\nWe were like \r\nUp all night\r\nCrazy like \r\nKids at Christmas\r\n\r\nAnd outside it snowed \r\nbut we never got cold\r\nI didn\'t wanna let you go, no.\r\nCause you got that I need \r\nbut I knew she had to leave \r\nlast train home Christmas eve   \r\nShe said \'Darlin you know that I don\'t understand\r\nSometimes you gotta leave to know what you have\'\r\nBut I\'d fallen in love like the snow from the sky\r\nIt was the best damn day of my life, yeah. \r\n\r\nWe were like \r\nUp all night\r\nCrazy like \r\nKids at Christmas\r\n\r\nWhen I\'m with you, I got all I need\r\nlike Christmas everyday until New Year\'s Eve. \r\nWhen I\'m with you, I don\'t ever want to sleep.  \r\nI dunno why you had to go and leave\r\n\r\nWe were like \r\nUp all night\r\nCrazy like \r\nKids at Christmas','KLXcC8lvogY'),(461,'Merry Christmas','Big Big Train','santa-radio.jpg','Big Big Train is based in England and the bandâ€™s current line-up is Andy Poole, Danny Manners, David Longdon, Rikard Sjoblom, Nick Dâ€™Virgilio, Dave Gregory, Rachel Hall, Greg Spawton','https://www.bigbigtrain.com/','This material world\r\nIs spinning so fast\r\nRetailer sales targets smashed\r\nWe know the price\r\nBut not the real cost\r\nIs the true meaning\r\nOf Christmas lost?\r\n\r\nThere aren\'t enough\r\nHours in a day\r\nWhen did the ringing of tills\r\nDrown the pealing of bells?\r\nWho cares as long as the\r\nProducts sell?\r\n\r\nWhat wouldn\'t you give to\r\nBelieve again\r\nLike you believed back then?\r\n\r\nMerry Christmas\r\nMerry Christmas\r\nGive a little peace, joy\r\nLove and light\r\nTo the world\r\n\r\nThe Salvation Army band\r\nIs playing carols in the town\r\nThen somewhere deep\r\nInside ourselves\r\nA child awakes and says...\r\n\"Snow is falling downâ€ \r\n\r\nLight to the world\r\nLove in our hearts\r\n\r\nMerry Christmas\r\nMerry Christmas\r\nGive a little peace, joy\r\nLove and light\r\n\r\nTo the world','DINVlwX9aZM'),(462,'Have Yourself A Merry Little Christmas','James M Caddell','santa-radio.jpg','James has many years of experience singing Jazz/Broadway style with well-known artist; Loretta Lynn, Andy Gibb, as well as performing on the stages of Broadway in New York and Los Angeles. Many have said that James rich, deep voice wraps them up like a blanket on a cold day.','https://jamesmcaddellmusic.com/home','Have yourself a merry little Christmas\r\nLet your heart be light\r\nFrom now on your troubles will be out of sight\r\nHave yourself a merry little Christmas\r\nMake the Yuletide gay\r\nFrom now on your troubles will be miles away\r\nHere we are as in olden days\r\nHappy golden days of yore\r\nFaithful friends who are dear to us\r\nTGather near to us once more\r\nThrough the years we all will be together\r\nIf the fates allow\r\nHang a shining star upon the highest place\r\nSo have yourself a merry little Christmas\r\nHave yourself a merry little Christmas\r\nSo have yourself a merry little Christmas','-tJtsKngXJU'),(463,'Let it Snow','Peter Lemongello','santa-radio.jpg','Peter Lemongello is the first artist ever to sell over a million albums on TV with his double record set, Love 76.\r\nHe has appeared on The Tonight Show and every other major TV show in the late 70\'s early 80\'s and appeared\r\non the cover of The Wall Street Journal, People Magazine, The New York Times, and Cosmopolitan to name a few. -His life is being made into a major motion picture, Love 76, The Wild Saga of Peter Lemongello which will be released in late 2018.','https://www.facebook.com/peter.lemongello.967','Oh the weather outside is frightful\r\nBut the fire is so delightful\r\nAnd since we\'ve no place to go\r\nLet It Snow! Let It Snow! Let It Snow!\r\n\r\nIt doesn\'t show signs of stopping\r\nAnd I\'ve bought some corn for popping\r\nThe lights are turned way down low\r\nLet It Snow! Let It Snow! Let It Snow!\r\n\r\nWhen we finally kiss good night\r\nHow I\'ll hate going out in the storm!\r\nBut if you\'ll really hold me tight\r\nAll the way home I\'ll be warm\r\n\r\nThe fire is slowly dying\r\nAnd, my dear, we\'re still goodbying\r\nBut as long as you love me so\r\nLet It Snow! Let It Snow! Let It Snow!','wLqhduumlgI'),(464,'All I want for Christmas is you','Kate Grom','santa-radio.jpg','Kate Grom - singer of songs, teller of tales, rider of horses. \r\nHer 2017 debut Heroine was met with critical acclaim, described as â€œwhen country meets smo-o-othâ€. \r\nHer Americana version of perennial favorite â€œAll I Want For Christmas Is Youâ€, was inspired by her vintage vinyl collection, including favorites Emmylou Harris, Linda Ronstadt, and Dolly Parton. \r\nKate lives on a farm in New Jersey horse country. ','https://www.youtube.com/@kategrom9755','I don\'t want a lot for Christmas\r\nThere is just one thing I need\r\nI don\'t care about the presents\r\nUnderneath the Christmas tree\r\n\r\nI just want you for my own\r\nMore than you could ever know\r\nMake my wish come true\r\nAll I want for Christmas is you, yeah.\r\n\r\nI don\'t want a lot for Christmas\r\nThere is just one thing I need\r\nAnd I don\'t care about the presents\r\nUnderneath the Christmas tree\r\n\r\nI don\'t need to hang my stocking\r\nThere upon the fireplace\r\nSanta Claus won\'t make me happy\r\nWith a toy on Christmas Day\r\n\r\nI just want you for my own\r\nMore than you could ever know\r\nMake my wish come true\r\nAll I want for Christmas is you\r\nYou, baby\r\n\r\nOh, I won\'t ask for much this Christmas\r\nI won\'t even wish for snow\r\nAnd I\'m just gonna keep on waiting\r\nUnderneath the mistletoe\r\n\r\nI won\'t make a list and send it\r\nTo the North Pole for Saint Nick\r\nI won\'t even stay awake to\r\nHear those magic reindeer click\r\n\r\n\'Cause I just want you here tonight\r\nHolding on to me so tight\r\nWhat more can I do?\r\nBaby, all I want for Christmas is you\r\nYou, baby\r\n\r\nOh, all the lights are shining so brightly everywhere\r\nAnd the sound of children\'s laughter fills the air\r\n\r\nAnd everyone is singing\r\nI hear those sleigh bells ringing\r\nSanta, won\'t you bring me the one I really need?\r\nWon\'t you please bring my baby to me?\r\n\r\nOh, I don\'t want a lot for Christmas\r\nThis is all I\'m asking for\r\nI just wanna see my baby\r\nStanding right outside my door\r\n\r\nOh, I just want you for my own\r\nMore than you could ever know\r\nMake my wish come true\r\nBaby, all I want for Christmas is you\r\nYou, baby\r\n\r\nAll I want for Christmas is you, baby','uDhC6BpZv-0'),(466,'I havent wrapped a single gift','Nicholas Wells','santa-radio.jpg','Singer-Songwriter Nicholas Wells found his passion at a young age. Nicholas catalogue of inspiring original songs â€” a product of writing since the age of eight â€” chronicles his growth in life and as a songwriter. A few identifying characteristics of his vocal and piano driven music are his memorable melodies, emotional storytelling, and grandiose musical arrangements.','https://nicholaswellsmusic.com','I Havenâ€™t Wrapped A Single Gift - Nicholas Wells\r\n\r\nI havenâ€™t wrapped a single gift for christmas\r\nI havenâ€™t even started shopping at all\r\nI know it happens every year, till Christmas eve starts drawing near\r\nAnd then I spend the whole month at the mall.\r\n\r\nI havenâ€™t wrapped a single gift for christmas\r\nAnd Iâ€™m looking at the perfect thing online\r\nBut as I conclude my shopping spree, I check the date of delivery\r\nAnd unless I break the bank on postage it wonâ€™t be here in time!\r\n\r\nI keep saying that Iâ€™ll get my act together\r\nAnd make the season easy paced.\r\nBut long as Halloween is one month from December\r\nIâ€™ll probably always figure Iâ€™ve got time to waste\r\n\r\nI havenâ€™t wrapped a single gift for christmas\r\nI havenâ€™t even written out a tag.\r\nItâ€™s the 25th at 1:00am, and Iâ€™ve run out of tape again\r\nSo Iâ€™m just throwing everything into one big olâ€™ bag.\r\n\r\nI keep saying that Iâ€™ll get my act together\r\nAnd make the season easy paced.\r\nBut long as Halloween is one month from December\r\nIâ€™ll probably always figure Iâ€™ve got time to waste\r\n\r\nI havenâ€™t wrapped a single gift for christmas\r\nI havenâ€™t even written out a tag.\r\nItâ€™s the 25th at 1:00am, and Iâ€™ve run out of tape again\r\nSo Iâ€™m just throwing everything into one big olâ€™ bag.','YUikWMobcz4'),(467,'Honey come Home for Christmas','Kate Neve','santa-radio.jpg','Kate is a creative spirit who enjoys singing, dancing, acting, culinary and fashion.','https://kateneve.hearnow.com/','All the Christmas presents wrapped and underneath the tree Reading cards and letters, that youâ€™ve sent to me\r\nâ€œAll I need for Christmas is youâ€ on the radio\r\nWonderinâ€™ will I see you darlinâ€™, without you, Iâ€™m feelinâ€™ so alone Honey come home for Christmas\r\nThink by now youâ€™d know\r\nDonâ€™t need gifts, gold or money\r\nJust you, me and the mistletoe\r\nI donâ€™t care how you get here\r\nHurry, then weâ€™ll take it slow\r\nJust one wish, on my list, this Christmas\r\nPlease honey come home for Christmas\r\nOh honey come home for Christmas\r\nWhen Iâ€™m in your lovinâ€™ arms, the world seems so complete\r\nThereâ€™s no other place, that Iâ€™d rather be\r\nOh, I love you darlinâ€™ more than you could ever know\r\nReally want to show you darlinâ€™, would ya, could ya, baby hurry home, home Honey come home for Christmas\r\nThink by now youâ€™d know\r\nDonâ€™t need gifts, gold or money\r\nJust you, me and the mistletoe\r\nDonâ€™t care how you get here\r\nHurry, then weâ€™ll take it slow\r\nJust one wish, on my list, this Christmas\r\nPlease honey come home\r\nHoney come home for Christmas\r\nThink by now youâ€™d know\r\nDonâ€™t need gifts, gold or money\r\nJust you, me and the mistletoe\r\nDonâ€™t care how you get here\r\nHurry, then weâ€™ll take it slow\r\nJust one wish, on my list, this Christmas\r\nPlease honey come home for Christmas\r\nOoo honey come home for Christmas\r\nOoo Honey please come home','cQLglf-A_PM'),(468,'Its Christmas','Natalya K','santa-radio.jpg','Natalya K is a singer, songwriter and actress. Performs in various genres: jazz, funk, blues and pop. \'It\'s Christmas\' is the first festive track released in 2018 dedicated to the most favorite time of the year.','https://facebook.com/natalya.k.music/','What a day, everything shines around me,\r\nHeart\'s exited with upcoming night.\r\nChildren laugh in the park and so lovely\r\nTrees are decorated cause the world is waiting for the first star\'s light.\r\n\r\nDays are different unlucky or graceful,\r\nBut this one is the best you\'ll agree.\r\nSharing kindness and love we are careful\r\nLeaving all our wishes and the gifts under Christmas tree.\r\n\r\nMaybe tomorrow we\'ll forget about sorrow,\r\nMaybe tomorrow happiness will follow,\r\nMaybe... so I\'ll be praying all night.\r\n\r\nChristmas is coming to the town,\r\nI\'m catching snowflakes falling on the ground with mouth like child.\r\nNothing can bring my mood down,\r\nAnd every stranger, smilingÂ \r\nAll around, makes me joyful for a while.\r\n\r\nI want everyone to be happy this day,\r\nI want every heart to be blessed in every way,\r\nCause it\'s Christmas.\r\n\r\nEvery man knows it\'s special time\r\nLook, how miracles happen as well.\r\nEven if you have lost your last dime\r\nYour bad story also can turn into fairytale.\r\n\r\nMaybe tomorrow we\'ll forget about sorrow,\r\nMaybe tomorrow happiness will follow,\r\nMaybe.